# Hyphen License 1.0 (HLv1.0)

## Preamble

The Hyphen License 1.0 is an open-source, viral license designed to ensure that software and its derivatives remain freely available while permitting commercial use. This license combines the collaborative spirit of open-source with the flexibility for commercial applications, while maintaining strong copyleft provisions.

