- **"License"** refers to this Hyphen License 1.0.
- **"Work"** means any copyrightable work licensed under this License.
- **"Source Code"** means the preferred form of the Work for making modifications to it.
- **"Object Code"** means any non-source form of a Work.
- **"Derivative Work"** means any work based on or derived from the Work, including but not limited to modifications, translations, adaptations, or combinations with other works.
- **"Distribute"** means to make copies of the Work or Derivative Works available to others, whether for free or for a fee.

